    <h1>About HelpfulPet 🐾</h1>
    <p>We believe every pet deserves to travel in comfort and style.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-text">
      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>HelpfulPet was started by two pet-obsessed travelers who were tired of leaving their cats and dogs behind. After one too many stressful trips with the wrong gear, we set out to find the best travel products for pets — all in one place.</p>
      <p>Every item in our store has been selected for quality, safety, and real-world usability. Whether you're flying across the country or road-tripping to the mountains, we have everything your pet needs.</p>

      <h2>Our Values</h2>
      <ul class="values-list">
        <li>🐾 <strong>Pet First</strong> — We only carry products we'd use with our own animals.</li>
        <li>♻️ <strong>Sustainability</strong> — We prioritize eco-friendly and durable materials.</li>
        <li>✈️ <strong>Adventure Ready</strong> — Everything is tested for travel, not just the shelf.</li>
        <li>❤️ <strong>Community</strong> — Built by pet lovers, for pet lovers.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="about-team">
